Taken together, the four documents do not verify the proposed assurances. Dispatch: the documented promise is within two working days after payment confirmation, excluding preordered goods—not a guarantee of next-working-day dispatch for every paid order. Returns: the assurance about personalized goods contradicts their explicit exclusion. The policy accepts unopened goods within ten calendar days when a receipt is provided, subject to that exclusion. Postage: payment for every return is unsupported; Moss pays return postage for goods damaged in transit if photographs were recorded on delivery. Responsibility for change-of-mind return postage and its cost are unstated, so neither free returns nor a customer charge can be inferred. Pickup: indefinite holding without written approval contradicts the three-working-day holding period after the ready notice. Collection beyond that period requires a written extension; without one, the order is cancelled.

Основания и границы:
Проверяемое утверждение: Moss dispatches every paid order by the next working day, accepts personalized goods back within ten calendar days with a receipt, pays postage for every return, and holds pickup orders indefinitely without written approval.
radik:source:1acbfbdcdf8f51c2f55b4fa6cbe9c21a [0:166] Moss holds pickup orders for three working days after the ready notice. Collection after that period requires a written extension; without it the order is cancelled.

radik:source:28933688e506f12e3a0a47cc06b49e21 [0:159] Moss accepts unopened goods for return within ten calendar days when the customer provides a receipt. Personalized goods are excluded from this return policy.

radik:source:0d8f720709ed713644ad7f00ba3f3b2a [0:151] Fictional Store Moss dispatches paid orders within two working days after payment confirmation. The stated dispatch promise excludes preordered goods.

radik:source:1cd494ee12d258a80d0ba62854eca58b [0:169] Moss pays return postage for goods damaged in transit if photographs were recorded on delivery. The documents do not state who pays postage for a change-of-mind return.


Неопределённость: Change-of-mind return postage responsibility and cost are unstated. The dispatch policy does not guarantee next-working-day dispatch or establish a dispatch deadline for preordered goods.
Проверены точные байты цитат и источники. Внешняя истинность и смысловое следование не удостоверены.

Сохранённый материал результата; свежесть, источники и локальный Root проверяются заново при использовании. SAVE не разрешён.
